  "bodyHash": "1417e1ffad099c52",
  "content": "\n\n<h1><strong>Iron Frost</strong></h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/80a81a3804ab4c76ca423f0799a4a9cf85ab80ac_0.webp\" alt=\"Iron Frost 标题卡\"> 在 <strong>Iron Frost</strong> 中抵御严寒。在这片冰雪之地，你可以雇佣并管理市民来建设你的城市，凭借蒸汽的力量，你或许能征服这片雪原。</p>\n<p>本整合包围绕三大核心模组构建：<strong>Create</strong> 提供蒸汽朋克自动化，<strong>Minecolonies</strong> 用于建造和管理你的专属城市，<strong>Terralith</strong> 搭配若干配置模组将整个地图变为雪地。</p>\n<p>这些模组与其他众多添加内容共同营造了一个可供探索与生存的冰雪冬日仙境。整体体验偏向休闲放松，没有极端天气或过于棘手的怪物，旨在为休闲玩家提供一次独特的寒冷生存之旅。</p>\n<p><strong>大型整合包</strong> 需要分配至少 4GB 内存。在启动器中前往设置 -&gt; 游戏特定设置：“Minecraft” -&gt; Java 设置：分配内存 -&gt; 设置为 4096MB 或更高。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/91639e022d24980c8bdc183510f4fad89d99c033.png\" alt=\"模组列表宽屏\"></p>\n<h2>光影包</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fcomplementary-unbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complementary Unbound</a></p>\n<h2>资源包</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252funique-dark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Unique Dark</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ftorches-reimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Torches Reimagined</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffresh-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252falternative-rain-sounds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alternative Rain Sounds</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbetter-leaves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Leaves</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffast-better-grass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fast Better Grass</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsimple-grass-flowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple Grass Flowers</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsimple-lower-grass-sides\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple Lower Grass Sides</a></p>\n<h2>模组</h2>\n<p><strong>Create：</strong><br>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-steam-n-rails\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Steam n Rails</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fslice-and-dice\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Slice and Dice</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-deco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Deco</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcopycats\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Copycats</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-big-cannons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Big Cannons</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-enchantment-industry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enchantment Industry</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-connected\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Connected</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-power-loader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Power Loader</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-cobblestone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Cobblestone</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-tfmg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create TFMG</a></p>\n<p><strong>Minecolonies：</strong><br>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecolonies.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecolonies</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/structurize\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Structurize</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/multi-piston\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Multi Piston</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blockui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blockui</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/domum-ornamentum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Domum Ornamentum</a></p>\n<p><strong>地形生成：</strong><br>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fterralith\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Terralith</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252ftectonic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tectonic</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbiome-replacer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biome Replacer</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252feternal-winter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eternal Winter</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsnow-under-trees-remastered\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Snow Under Trees Remastered</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fremove-terralith-intro-message\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Remove Terralith Intro Message</a></p>\n<p><strong>环境效果：</strong><br>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsnow-real-magic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Snow Real Magic</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fambientsounds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ambient Sounds</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sound</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcave-dust\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cave Dust</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnaturalist\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Naturalist</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpresence-footsteps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Presence Footsteps</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmore-mob-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Mob Variants</a></p>\n<p><strong>性能优化：</strong><br>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fembeddium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Embeddium</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252firis-flw-compat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iris flw compat</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmediatelyfast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immediately Fast</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fferrite-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ferrite core</a></p>\n<p><strong>额外实用工具：</strong><br>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252foculus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oculus</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fappleskin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AppleSkin</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cosmetic-armor-reworked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cosmetic-Armor-Reworked</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252felytra-trims\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Elytra Trims</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffreecam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Freecam</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fhourglass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hourglass</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmore-chest-variants-lieonlion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Chest Variants</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fquad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quad</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsearchables\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Searchables</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftorchmaster\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Torchmaster</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252ftrimmable-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Trimmable Tools</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fplugin%252fworldedit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Worldedit</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpersonality!\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Personality</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fchipped\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chipped</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmers Delight</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpolymorph\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Polymorph</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsophisticated-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Backpacks</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fxaeros-world-map\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaeros World Map</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnatures-compass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Natures Compass</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreeper-firework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Creeper Firework</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fno-enderman-grief\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">No Enderman Grief</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fjade\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jade</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fjade-addons-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jade Addons Forge</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fjei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fjust-enough-resources-jer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Resources</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcold-sweat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cold Sweat</a></p>\n<p><strong>前置库：</strong><br>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Texture Features</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Model Features</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fblueprint\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blueprint</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreativecore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Creative Core</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fgeckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geckolib</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fkiwi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kiwi</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmru\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">M.R.U</a></p>",
